<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument</p><h1 class="enc-title">James Bond</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1953">1953</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">James Bond is a fictional British secret agent created by the novelist Ian Fleming in Casino Royale (1953). Fleming's novels and the long-running film series that began with Dr. No in 1962 made Bond, code number 007, one of the most widely known characters in popular culture and an enduring image of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> abroad.</p></div>
